  "description": "A dangerous love triangle between twin brothers.\n\nPeople call Seo-rin “the Cinderella who turned her life around,” a scandalous woman who walked a tightrope between two brothers and came out on top. \n\nAfter losing her parents, Seo-rin was adopted as the foster daughter of the powerful Taegang Group, where her most precious person became the eldest son, Tae Ha-jin. When Ha-jin falls into a coma after an accident, his twin brother Tae Si-jin approaches Seo-rin, and the perilous triangle begins. \n\n“Amazing. Tae Ha-jin still has that much influence over you.” \n\n“Ha-jin is… the most precious person to me.” \n\n“Ah, your first love.” \n\nTo continue Ha-jin’s life-support treatment, Seo-rin needs Si-jin’s consent. But the only thing Si-jin offers in return is a gaze full of impure intentions. \n\n“There’s only one thing you can sell to me.”\n\nIn the end, to save Ha-jin, Seo-rin agrees to marry his twin brother Si-jin. Yet on their wedding day, Ha-jin miraculously opens his eyes…\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13146925), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3498025987), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/btf_restr), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/beautiful_restraint), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000074730)",
